{"ref":"BDB, חֶ֫רֶס","hw":"חֶ֫רֶס","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">חֶ֫רֶס</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Judges 14:18\" href=\"/Judges.14.18\">Ju 14:18</a></sup> <strong>sun (</strong>NH <em>id.</em><strong>)</strong>—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ח׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 9:7\" href=\"/Job.9.7\">Jb 9:7</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">כוכבים</span>); c. ה epenth. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּטֶרֶם יָבֹא הַחַ֫רְסָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 14:18\" href=\"/Judges.14.18\">Ju 14:18</a> (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, לַ֫יְלָה\" href=\"/BDB,_לַ֫יְלָה\", dir=\"rtl\">לַיִל</a>, <a data-ref=\"BDB, לַ֫יְלָה\" href=\"/BDB,_לַ֫יְלָה\", dir=\"rtl\">לַיְלָה</a>) before the <em>sun</em> could go down (but read perhaps <span dir=\"rtl\">הַחַ֫דְרָה</span> <em>into the</em> (bridal) <em>chamber</em> Sta<sup>ZAW 1884, 253 ff.</sup>).","next":"BDB, חֶ֫רֶס²","prev":"BDB, חרס"}